---
title: Seafood Hot Dish
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Casseroles
cook time: 30 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@crab meat{1%can}
@shrimp meat{2%cups}
@mayonnaise{2%cups}
@celery{2%cups}
@finely chopped green pepper{1}
@finely chopped onion{1}
@chopped hard-boiled eggs{4}
@salt{1%tsp}
@Worcestershire sauce{2%tsp}
@paprika{1%tsp}
@sliced fresh mushrooms{1%cup}
@potato chips

Mix together and put into a 9x13 pan. Crush potato chips and put on top. Bake for 30 minutes at 350 degrees.
